# Artifacts and secrets must never be baked into an image. Here a pattern only matches at the root
# of the build context, unless it starts with **/. That matters: the Dockerfile copies all of src/.
**/data/
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log

# Tests stay out of the image
**/*.test.ts
tests

.git
.github
**/node_modules
coverage
docs
